<main><section class="page-space"><div class="narrow"><h1 class="section-title">Economic Calendar</h1><p class="section-lead">Keep track of key economic events and market updates in real time. Utilize Bytrox Global economic calendar to plan your trades with precision and confidence.</p><div class="calendar-grid"><article class="calendar-card"><span class="calendar-card-icon"><img src="${ctx}/images/calendar-alert.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Major Market Movers</h3><p>Stay alert to key economic events that drive strong market volatility and create prime trading setups.</p></article><article class="calendar-card"><span class="calendar-card-icon"><img src="${ctx}/images/calendar-clock.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Live Economic Data</h3><p>Receive instant updates on market reports, policy changes, and central bank statements as they are released.</p></article><article class="calendar-card"><span class="calendar-card-icon"><img src="${ctx}/images/calendar-bars.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Worldwide Insights</h3><p>Track global developments from leading economies such as the U.S., Europe, the U.K., Japan, Australia, and beyond.</p></article></div><section class="events-box"><h3>Trading Around Economic Events</h3><div class="events-cols"><div class="event-col"><span class="event-icon"><img src="${ctx}/images/calendar-check.svg" alt=""></span><ul><li>Track major market events ahead of release</li><li>Evaluation between forecasts and actual outcomes</li><li>Apply risk management to navigate volatility</li><li>Analyze correlations between economic events and currencies</li></ul></div><div class="event-col"><span class="event-icon"><img src="${ctx}/images/calendar-warning.svg" alt=""></span><ul><li>Central bank policy and rate announcements</li><li>Employment data (NFP, unemployment rates)</li><li>Inflation reports (CPI, PPI)</li><li>Economic growth metrics like GDP and manufacturing reports</li></ul></div></div></section><div class="center mt40"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">OPEN ACCOUNT</a></div></div></section></main>
